WEBVTT

00:00.720 --> 00:02.120
This jade thumb ring

00:02.240 --> 00:04.080
Is an old thing brought from the northern lands

00:04.160 --> 00:05.160
In my view

00:05.240 --> 00:06.760
It's not just an object

00:06.840 --> 00:08.840
But a remembrance of the north

00:14.800 --> 00:16.160
This general understands

00:16.240 --> 00:17.840
Your Highness and Minister Xie

00:17.960 --> 00:19.480
Are both people who remember the past

00:19.560 --> 00:20.960
Haven't forgotten the north

00:21.360 --> 00:22.640
Then this gift

00:22.720 --> 00:24.120
I, Zu

00:24.360 --> 00:25.760
Will shamelessly accept

00:33.200 --> 00:34.640
The inner hall is about to begin the banquet

00:34.720 --> 00:35.400
Prince of Jin

00:35.480 --> 00:36.320
Prince of Ning

00:36.440 --> 00:37.280
Please

00:37.360 --> 00:38.680
Please

